
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>ÖzelRehberNET</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #eef1f5;
      color: #182230;
      padding: 16px 10px 40px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    .app-shell {
      max-width: 1140px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid #d5dde8;
    }

    .topbar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .brand-icon {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background-color: #eef4ff;
      color: #1e4ed8;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 17px;
      border: 1px solid #d4e2fc;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .brand-name {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #162a45;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }

    .brand-name span {
      color: #1e4ed8;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .nav-btn {
      background-color: transparent;
      border: none;
      padding: 7px 11px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #5c6b7e;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .nav-btn:hover {
      background-color: #f5f8fc;
      color: #162a45;
    }

    .nav-btn.active {
      background-color: #eaf1ff;
      color: #1e4ed8;
    }

    .topbar-right {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background-color: #1e4ed8;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: none;
      padding: 9px 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background-color: #173fb0;
    }

    .btn-xs {
      padding: 5px 11px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .btn-navy {
      background-color: #162a45;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: none;
      padding: 9px 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-teal {
      background-color: #20a4b8;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: none;
      padding: 8px 13px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-full-mt {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .btn-full {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .btn-outline {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      color: #182230;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      padding: 8px 13px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      background-color: #f5f8fc;
    }

    .btn-sm {
      padding: 5px 10px;
    }

    .user-chip {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background-color: #f5f8fc;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      padding: 5px 12px 5px 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #162a45;
    }

    .user-avatar {
      width: 25px;
      height: 25px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #162a45;
      color: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .status-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #38b27b;
    }

    .screen {
      display: none;
    }

    .screen.active {
      display: block;
    }

    .hero-band {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #e7f0fb 100%);
      padding: 34px 22px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #162a45;
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .search-box-wrap {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto 26px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #d5dfec;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 5px 6px 5px 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(22, 42, 69, 0.08);
    }

    .search-box-wrap input {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
      border: none;
      outline: none;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      color: #182230;
      background-color: transparent;
    }

    .search-circle-btn {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: none;
      background-color: #e6f4f6;
      color: #20a4b8;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .audience-grid {
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .audience-card {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(22, 42, 69, 0.06);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .audience-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 16.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #162a45;
    }

    .audience-desc {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: #5c6b7e;
      line-height: 1.48;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .audience-btn {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #d6dfeb;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #162a45;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .audience-btn:hover {
      background-color: #f5f8fc;
    }

    .quick-tiles-band {
      padding: 22px 22px 28px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
    }

    .quick-tiles-grid {
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .quick-tile {
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 15px 16px;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .tile-navy { background-color: #162a45; }
    .tile-teal { background-color: #20a4b8; }
    .tile-green { background-color: #38b27b; }
    .tile-orange { background-color: #f59e0b; }

    .page-inner {
      padding: 22px 22px 32px;
    }

    .page-inner-tight {
      padding-top: 8px;
    }

    .search-page-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .search-page-top h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #162a45;
    }

    .search-controls {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 420px;
    }

    .search-inline-input {
      margin: 0;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .folder-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .folder-bar-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #162a45;
      margin-right: 4px;
    }

    .folder-pill {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #d5dfec;
      color: #182230;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .folder-pill.active {
      background-color: #1e4ed8;
      color: #ffffff;
      border-color: #1e4ed8;
    }

    .search-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 270px;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .results-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .result-card {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(22, 42, 69, 0.04);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
    }

    .result-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(30, 78, 216, 0.12);
      border-color: #b9d2fe;
    }

    .result-card.featured {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .result-title {
      font-size: 15.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #162a45;
    }

    .result-excerpt {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #5c6b7e;
    }

    .result-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #5c6b7e;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .badge-legal {
      background-color: #e6f6ee;
      color: #1f7a52;
      padding: 3px 9px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 11.5px;
    }

    .badge-blue {
      background-color: #eef4ff;
      color: #1e4ed8;
    }

    .badge-folder {
      background-color: #fef3c7;
      color: #92400e;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 11px;
      display: inline-block;
      width: fit-content;
    }

    .read-more-link {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1e4ed8;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .pagination-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .page-num {
      min-width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      padding: 0 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .page-num.active {
      background-color: #1e4ed8;
      color: #ffffff;
      border-color: #1e4ed8;
    }

    .filter-panel {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px;
    }

    .filter-group {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      padding: 10px 0;
    }

    .filter-group:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .filter-group-title {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #162a45;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .filter-option {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .date-input,
    .form-input,
    .form-select,
    .form-textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 8px 11px;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      border-radius: 7px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #182230;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    .date-input {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .events-main-title {
      font-size: 23px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #162a45;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .events-filter-bar {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .filter-pills-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #5c6b7e;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .pills-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .pill-btn {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #182230;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .pill-btn.active {
      background-color: #162a45;
      color: #ffffff;
      border-color: #162a45;
    }

    .calendar-events-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .calendar-card {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px;
    }

    .cal-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .cal-month-title {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #162a45;
    }

    .cal-weekdays {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(7, minmax(0, 1fr));
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #5c6b7e;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .cal-days {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(7, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 5px;
    }

    .cal-day {
      min-height: 58px;
      border: 1px solid #e7edf5;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 4px;
      font-size: 12px;
      background-color: #fbfcfe;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .cal-day.muted {
      color: #b0bac7;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .cal-day.selected {
      outline: 2px solid #1e4ed8;
    }

    .ev-tag {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 2px 4px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-top: 2px;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .tag-blue { background-color: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
    .tag-green { background-color: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
    .tag-yellow { background-color: #fef9c3; color: #854d0e; }

    .event-cards-col {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .event-card {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px;
    }

    .event-thumb {
      width: 108px;
      min-height: 102px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 8px;
      font-size: 11.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .thumb-1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2b6cb0, #38b2ac); }
    .thumb-2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b, #3b82f6); }
    .thumb-3 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #38bdf8); }

    .event-body {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .event-title {
      font-size: 14.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #162a45;
    }

    .event-meta {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #5c6b7e;
    }

    .law-hero {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #e7f0fb 100%);
      padding: 30px 22px 22px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e6eef8;
    }

    .law-hero h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #162a45;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .law-hero p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #5c6b7e;
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .law-list {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 20px auto 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .law-card {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .law-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .law-icon {
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background-color: #eef4ff;
      color: #1e4ed8;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 24px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .law-title {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #162a45;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .law-desc {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #5c6b7e;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .law-count {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #5c6b7e;
    }

    .sub-hero-center {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 12px 10px 20px;
    }

    .sub-hero-left {
      text-align: left;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .sub-hero-center h1 {
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #162a45;
    }

    .lawyer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(0, 0.85fr);
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .lawyer-search-wrap {
      max-width: 100%;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .accordion-item {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .accordion-head {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: none;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      text-align: left;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .accordion-title {
      font-size: 14.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #162a45;
    }

    .accordion-sub {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #5c6b7e;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .accordion-toggle {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #5c6b7e;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .accordion-body {
      display: none;
      padding: 12px 16px 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #182230;
      border-top: 1px solid #f0f4f9;
    }

    .accordion-item.open .accordion-body {
      display: block;
    }

    .side-form-card {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(22, 42, 69, 0.06);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .side-form-header {
      background-color: #162a45;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .side-form-body {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .network-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .panel-box {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(22, 42, 69, 0.04);
    }

    .panel-title {
      font-size: 15.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #162a45;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .expert-mini {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .expert-circle {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #dbeafe;
      color: #162a45;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .expert-name {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #162a45;
    }

    .expert-role {
      font-size: 11.5px;
      color: #5c6b7e;
    }

    .summary-text {
      font-size: 12.5px;
      color: #5c6b7e;
    }

    .stack-form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .assistant-band {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #e7f0fb 100%);
      padding: 30px 22px 34px;
    }

    .assistant-top {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
    }

    .assistant-avatar {
      width: 58px;
      height: 58px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #dce9f9;
      color: #162a45;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 26px;
      margin: 0 auto 12px;
      border: 2px solid #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(22, 42, 69, 0.08);
    }

    .assistant-top h1 {
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #162a45;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .assistant-top p {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: #5c6b7e;
    }

    .chat-input-bar {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto 22px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #d5dfec;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 6px 8px 6px 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(22, 42, 69, 0.07);
    }

    .chat-input-bar input {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
      border: none;
      outline: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #182230;
      background-color: transparent;
    }

    .chat-send-btn {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: none;
      background-color: #20a4b8;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .qa-sections {
      max-width: 1020px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .qa-section-title {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #162a45;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      padding-bottom: 4px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #dbeafe;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .qa-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .qa-card-btn {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #dce5f0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px;
      text-align: left;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(22, 42, 69, 0.04);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
    }

    .qa-card-btn:hover {
      border-color: #1e4ed8;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(30, 78, 216, 0.1);
      background-color: #f8fbff;
    }

    .qa-card-text {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #182230;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .qa-card-footer {
      font-size: 11.5px;
      color: #5c6b7e;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .assistant-answer-box {
      max-width: 1020px;
      margin: 22px auto 0;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #cbd9ec;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px 22px;
      display: none;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(22, 42, 69, 0.08);
    }

    .assistant-answer-box.active {
      display: block;
    }

    .answer-q-label {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #1e4ed8;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      padding-bottom: 6px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .answer-body-text {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #182230;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    mark.hl {
      background-color: #fef08a;
      color: #162a45;
      padding: 0 3px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .toast {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 18px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background-color: #162a45;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 999;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    }

    .toast.show {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      z-index: 1000;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .modal-overlay.active {
      display: flex;
    }

    .modal-container {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 720px;
      max-height: 85vh;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .modal-header {
      padding: 18px 22px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .modal-title-box {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .modal-badge-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .modal-title {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #162a45;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .modal-close-btn {
      background: none;
      border: none;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #5c6b7e;
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .modal-body {
      padding: 22px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      color: #182230;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .modal-footer {
      padding: 14px 22px;
      border-top: 1px solid #dfe6ef;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 920px) {
      .qa-grid, .lawyer-grid, .network-grid {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .results-grid, .audience-grid, .quick-tiles-grid {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="brand" id="brandHomeBtn">
        <div class="brand-icon">⚖️</div>
        <div class="brand-name">ÖzelRehber<span>NET</span></div>
      </div>

      <nav class="nav-links">
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn active" data-screen="home">Ana Sayfa</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-screen="search">Arama</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-screen="events">Etkinlik Takvimi</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-screen="laws">Yasal Haklar</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-screen="lawyer">Avukat Masası</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-screen="network">Uzman &amp; Öğretmen</button>
        <button type="button" class="nav-btn" data-screen="assistant">Soru Rehberi</button>
      </nav>

      <div class="topbar-right" id="topbarRight">
        <button type="button" class="btn-primary" id="topAuthBtn">Login / Signup</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ANA SAYFA -->
    <section class="screen active" id="screen-home">
      <div class="hero-band">
        <h1 class="hero-title">Özel Eğitimde Güçlü Köprü: Haklarınız ve Rehberiniz Tek Yerde</h1>

        <form class="search-box-wrap" id="heroSearchForm">
          <input type="search" id="heroSearchInput" placeholder="Örn; ÇÖZGER, RAM raporu, VAKT, disleksi, BEP, yasal körlük..." />
          <button type="submit" class="search-circle-btn" title="Ara">🔍</button>
        </form>

        <div class="audience-grid">
          <div class="audience-card">
            <div>
              <div class="audience-head">👨‍👩‍👧 Aileler İçin ÇÖZGER</div>
              <p class="audience-desc">ÇÖZGER raporu, ÖGV/BÖGV/ÖKGV hakları ve 2019 Resmî Gazete esasları.</p>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="audience-btn" id="homeFamiliesBtn">Tüm ÇÖZGER Soruları</button>
          </div>

          <div class="audience-card">
            <div>
              <div class="audience-head">📋 Eğitsel Tanılama &amp; BEP</div>
              <p class="audience-desc">RAM gönderme, En Az Kısıtlayıcı Eğitim Ortamı ve BEP birimi görevleri.</p>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="audience-btn" id="homeIndividualsBtn">BEP Sorularını İncele</button>
          </div>

          <div class="audience-card">
            <div>
              <div class="audience-head">👩‍🏫 Okuma, Yazma &amp; Biliş</div>
              <p class="audience-desc">VAKT yöntemi, sesbilgisel farkındalık, metin yapısı ve yazılı ifade adımları.</p>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="audience-btn" id="homeTeachersBtn">Stratejileri Öğren</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quick-tiles-band">
        <div class="quick-tiles-grid">
          <button type="button" class="quick-tile tile-navy" data-go="laws"><span>⚖️</span> Yasal Haklar</button>
          <button type="button" class="quick-tile tile-teal" id="tileInstitutionsBtn"><span>🎓</span> Eğitim Kurumları</button>
          <button type="button" class="quick-tile tile-green" data-go="network"><span>🤝</span> Destekler</button>
          <button type="button" class="quick-tile tile-orange" data-go="assistant"><span>💬</span> SSS</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ARAMA EKRANI -->
    <section class="screen" id="screen-search">
      <div class="page-inner">
        <div class="search-page-top">
          <h2 id="searchResultsHeading">Arama Sonuçları</h2>
          <div class="search-controls">
            <input type="search" id="pageSearchInput" class="date-input search-inline-input" placeholder="Anahtar kelime ara (Örn: ÇÖZGER, 6 ay, VAKT, ÖKGV, BEP)..." />
            <button type="button" class="btn-outline" id="clearFiltersBtn">Filtreleri Temizle</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="folder-bar" id="folderFilterBar">
          <span class="folder-bar-label">📁 Klasörler:</span>
          <button type="button" class="folder-pill active" data-folder="Tümü">Tümü</button>
          <button type="button" class="folder-pill" data-folder="ÇÖZGER & Tıbbi Değerlendirme">ÇÖZGER &amp; Tıbbi Değerlendirme</button>
          <button type="button" class="folder-pill" data-folder="Tanılama, RAM & BEP">Tanılama, RAM &amp; BEP</button>
          <button type="button" class="folder-pill" data-folder="Okuma, Yazma & Biliş">Okuma, Yazma &amp; Biliş</button>
          <button type="button" class="folder-pill" data-folder="Sık Sorulan Sorular (SSS)">Sık Sorulan Sorular (SSS)</button>
        </div>

        <div class="search-layout">
          <div>
            <div class="results-grid" id="searchResultsGrid"></div>
            <div class="pagination-bar" id="paginationBar"></div>
          </div>

          <aside class="filter-panel">
            <div class="filter-group">
              <div class="filter-group-title">Kategoriler ˄</div>
              <label class="filter-option"><input type="checkbox" class="cat-check" value="Yasal Haklar" /> Yasal Haklar</label>
              <label class="filter-option"><input type="checkbox" class="cat-check" value="Eğitim Kurumları" /> Eğitim Kurumları</label>
              <label class="filter-option"><input type="checkbox" class="cat-check" value="Uzman Makaleleri" /> Uzman Makaleleri</label>
            </div>

            <div class="filter-group">
              <div class="filter-group-title">İçerik Tipi ˄</div>
              <label class="filter-option"><input type="checkbox" class="type-check" value="Makale" /> Makale</label>
              <label class="filter-option"><input type="checkbox" class="type-check" value="Rehber" /> Rehber</label>
              <label class="filter-option"><input type="checkbox" class="type-check" value="Soru-Cevap" /> Soru-Cevap</label>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ETKİNLİK TAKVİMİ -->
    <section class="screen" id="screen-events">
      <div class="page-inner">
        <h1 class="events-main-title">Özel Eğitim Şenlikleri, Seminerler ve Tatil Programları</h1>

        <div class="events-filter-bar">
          <div>
            <div class="filter-pills-label">Tüm Kategoriler</div>
            <div class="pills-row" id="eventCategoryPills">
              <button type="button" class="pill-btn active" data-cat="Tümü">Tümü</button>
              <button type="button" class="pill-btn" data-cat="Seminer">Seminer</button>
              <button type="button" class="pill-btn" data-cat="Şenlik">Şenlik</button>
              <button type="button" class="pill-btn" data-cat="Tatil">Tatil</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="filter-pills-label">Tüm Konumlar</div>
            <div class="pills-row" id="eventLocationPills">
              <button type="button" class="pill-btn active" data-loc="Tümü">Tümü</button>
              <button type="button" class="pill-btn" data-loc="İstanbul">İstanbul</button>
              <button type="button" class="pill-btn" data-loc="Ankara">Ankara</button>
              <button type="button" class="pill-btn" data-loc="İzmir">İzmir</button>
              <button type="button" class="pill-btn" data-loc="Online">Online</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="calendar-events-grid">
          <div class="calendar-card">
            <div class="cal-header">
              <button type="button" class="btn-outline btn-sm" id="calPrevBtn">Başlangıç</button>
              <div class="cal-month-title">‹ Ekim 2026 ›</div>
              <button type="button" class="btn-primary btn-xs" id="calTodayBtn">5 Ekim</button>
            </div>
            <div class="cal-weekdays">
              <div>Pzt</div><div>Sal</div><div>Çar</div><div>Per</div><div>Cum</div><div>Cmt</div><div>Paz</div>
            </div>
            <div class="cal-days" id="calendarGrid"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="event-cards-col" id="eventCardsList"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- YASAL HAKLAR -->
    <section class="screen" id="screen-laws">
      <div class="law-hero">
        <h1>Özel Eğitimde Yasal Haklar ve Mevzuat</h1>
        <p>Türkiye'deki özel gereksinimli bireyler ve aileleri için kapsamlı yasal haklar rehberi ve ÇÖZGER esasları.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="page-inner page-inner-tight">
        <div class="law-list">
          <div class="law-card">
            <div class="law-left">
              <div class="law-icon">⚖️</div>
              <div>
                <div class="law-title">Eğitimde Fırsat Eşitliği ve Haklar</div>
                <div class="law-desc">Özel gereksinimli çocukların eğitim hakları, 20 Şubat 2019 tarihli ÇÖZGER mevzuatı ve uygulamalar.</div>
                <div class="law-count">📄 12 makale</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="btn-primary" id="lawEqualityBtn">Detaylı Oku</button>
          </div>

          <div class="law-card">
            <div class="law-left">
              <div class="law-icon">📋</div>
              <div>
                <div class="law-title">Mevzuat ve Yönetmelikler</div>
                <div class="law-desc">MEB özel eğitim hizmetleri yönetmelikleri, RAM yönlendirme ve BEP hazırlama esasları.</div>
                <div class="law-count">📄 8 makale</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="btn-primary" id="lawRegulationsBtn">Detaylı Oku</button>
          </div>

          <div class="law-card">
            <div class="law-left">
              <div class="law-icon">🤝</div>
              <div>
                <div class="law-title">Ailenin ve Bireyin Hukuki Güvencesi</div>
                <div class="law-desc">Ailelerin yasal süreçlerdeki rolleri, başvuru hakları, itiraz yolları ve sağlanan destekler.</div>
                <div class="law-count">📄 15 makale</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="btn-primary" data-go="lawyer">Avukat Masasına Git</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AVUKAT MASASI -->
    <section class="screen" id="screen-lawyer">
      <div class="page-inner">
        <div class="sub-hero-center">
          <h1>Hukuksal Haklar ve Uzman Avukat Danışma Masası</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="lawyer-grid">
          <div>
            <div class="panel-title">Hukuki Kaynaklar ve Makaleler</div>

            <form class="search-box-wrap lawyer-search-wrap" id="lawyerSearchForm">
              <input type="search" id="lawyerSearchInput" placeholder="Örn; ÇÖZGER, kaynaştırma, itiraz, BEP..." />
              <button type="submit" class="search-circle-btn">🔍</button>
            </form>

            <div class="accordion-item">
              <button type="button" class="accordion-head">
                <div>
                  <div class="accordion-title">🏛️ Özel Eğitim Yasaları ve Yönetmelikleri</div>
                  <div class="accordion-sub">Özel eğitim hizmetleri yönetmelikleri, temel mevzuat ve uygulama esasları</div>
                </div>
                <span class="accordion-toggle">+</span>
              </button>
              <div class="accordion-body">
                Özel gereksinimli bireylerin eğitim hakları, BEP geliştirme birimi görevleri ve destek eğitim hizmetlerine ilişkin temel mevzuat özetleri bu başlık altında yer alır.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item open">
              <button type="button" class="accordion-head">
                <div>
                  <div class="accordion-title">✍️ İtiraz ve Dava Yolları</div>
                  <div class="accordion-sub">Eğitsel değerlendirme itirazları, idari başvurular ve hukuki süreçler</div>
                </div>
                <span class="accordion-toggle">−</span>
              </button>
              <div class="accordion-body">
                RAM eğitsel değerlendirme kararına itiraz süreleri, dilekçe adımları ve idari yargı başvurularına dair rehber bilgiler sahada genişletilecek.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="side-form-card">
              <div class="side-form-header">Avukata Soru Sor / Danışma Talep Et</div>
              <form class="side-form-body" id="lawyerRequestForm">
                <input type="text" class="form-input" placeholder="Ad Soyad" required />
                <input type="email" class="form-input" placeholder="E-posta Adresi" required />
                <input type="tel" class="form-input" placeholder="Telefon Numarası" />
                <select class="form-select">
                  <option value="">Konu Başlığı Seçin</option>
                  <option>Kaynaştırma ve BEP Hakları</option>
                  <option>RAM Kararına İtiraz</option>
                  <option>Destek Eğitim ve Ücretler</option>
                </select>
                <textarea rows="3" class="form-textarea" placeholder="Mesajınız..."></textarea>
                <button type="submit" class="btn-navy">🔒 Talebi Gönder</button>
              </form>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- UZMAN & ÖĞRETMEN -->
    <section class="screen" id="screen-network">
      <div class="page-inner">
        <div class="sub-hero-center sub-hero-left">
          <h1>Uzmanlarla ve Öğretmenlerle İletişim Ağı</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="network-grid">
          <div class="panel-box">
            <div class="panel-title">Kaynaştırma öğrencisi için BEP nasıl hazırlanmalı?</div>
            <div class="expert-mini">
              <div class="expert-circle">EY</div>
              <div>
                <div class="expert-name">Dr. Elif Yılmaz</div>
                <div class="expert-role">Özel Eğitim Uzmanı</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="summary-text">
              BEP, öğrencinin mevcut performans düzeyi, RAM eğitsel değerlendirme raporu ve kısa-uzun dönemli hedefler doğrultusunda hazırlanır.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="panel-box">
            <div class="panel-title">Öğretmen-Veli İletişim Talebi Oluştur</div>
            <form class="stack-form" id="networkRequestForm">
              <input type="text" class="form-input" placeholder="Konu Başlığı" />
              <textarea rows="3" class="form-textarea" placeholder="Mesajınızı yazın..."></textarea>
              <button type="submit" class="btn-navy btn-full">Talebi Gönder</button>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SORU REHBERİ -->
    <section class="screen" id="screen-assistant">
      <div class="assistant-band">
        <div class="assistant-top">
          <div class="assistant-avatar">👩‍🏫</div>
          <h1>Soru Rehberi ve Akademik Masası</h1>
          <p>Her bir sorunun kendine ait bağımsız kartı bulunmaktadır. Tıklayarak yanıtı görüntüleyebilirsiniz.</p>
        </div>

        <form class="chat-input-bar" id="assistantForm">
          <span>🔍</span>
          <input type="text" id="assistantInput" placeholder="Soru başlığı veya anahtar kelime yazın... (Örn: yasal körlük, VAKT, ÖKGV)" />
          <button type="submit" class="chat-send-btn" title="Gönder">➤</button>
